WEBVTT

00:03:28.037 --> 00:03:31.082
he got given a birthday
present, a go-cart.

00:03:31.540 --> 00:03:32.750
He was fast.

00:03:32.750 --> 00:03:35.962
He was so fast, that in 2003,

00:03:36.003 --> 00:03:39.298
Rudy won the Dutch national championships.

00:03:39.298 --> 00:03:40.800
He had dreams and aspirations

00:03:40.841 --> 00:03:43.344
of becoming a professional
Formula 1 driver.

00:03:43.386 --> 00:03:44.637
Then at 16,

00:03:44.637 --> 00:03:49.433
like so many people that are trying
to make that next step in the sport,

00:03:49.475 --> 00:03:51.185
it just became too expensive.

00:03:51.227 --> 00:03:54.105
And that dream for Rudy was over.

00:03:55.815 --> 00:03:58.985
I'm going to come back to Rudy later.

00:03:58.985 --> 00:04:01.779
Times change, and so does technology.